B. Claims Procedure
a. If the Insured Person is Hospitalized / underwent a Surgical Procedure or any medical condition
falling under purview of the definition of Serious Illness as mentioned in the Policy that may result
in a claim, then the Insured Person must provide intimation to Us immediately of the aforesaid
Illness/ condition/ surgical event and which can be received from You/Insured Person through
various modes like email / telephone/ fax/ in person or may be via letter or any other suitable mode.
Upon receipt of information, we will register the claim under a unique claim number.
b. The following details are to be provided at the time of intimation of claim:
a. The Policy Number/Certificate Number,
b. Name of the Policyholder;
c. Employee No./ Member ID
d. Name and address of the Insured Person in respect of whom the request is being made;
e. Nature of Illness or Injury and the treatment/Surgery taken;
f. Name and address of the attending Medical Practitioner;
g. Hospital where treatment/Surgery was taken;
h. Date of Occurrence of Insured Event or/and date of admission;
i. Any other information that may be relevant to the Illness/ Injury/ Hospitalization.
